<title>WESTERN SAMOA: RUGBY UNION-WESTERN SAMOA THRASH TONGA 62-13.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-WESTERN SAMOA THRASH TONGA 62-13.</headline>
<dateline>APIA, Western Samoa 1997-06-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Samoa beat Tonga 62-13 (half-time 31-3) in the Pacific tri-series tournament in Apia on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Western Samoa - Tries: Afato So'oalo (3), Junior Paramore (2), John Clarke, To'o Vaega, Robbie Ale, Sila Vaifale, Silao Leaega. Conversions: Leaega (5), Vaaiga Tuigamala.</p>
<p>Tonga - Tries: Alipate Taufo'ou. Conversions: Kusitafu Tonga. Penalties: Tonga (2).</p>
</text>
